he full rate (since 02/18/46), and</span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">at the <em>full rate</em> for U.S. residents effective 12/16/03</span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 12px; width: 13%; vertical-align: top\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">No</span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 12px; width: 13%; vertical-align: top\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Yes</span></span></div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">at <em>half</em> of the full rate (since 02/18/46), and</span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">at the full rate for U.S. residents effective 11/01/00</span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 12px; width: 13%; vertical-align: top\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Yes (since 04/25/51)</span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 12px; width: 13%; vertical-align: top\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Half of the full rate</span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t</tbody>\n\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\">\n<hr /></div>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: right\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style